# Staged by build.rs from transcribe-cpp's install dirs; never checked in.
vocript-src/src-tauri/transcribe-libs/

# The MSIX for the Store is assembled by copying the release build in here, so
# this folder holds ~180 MB of binaries: the exe, every native DLL and the
# packed .msix itself. None of it is source and none of it may reach a public
# repo, where a pushed 47 MB blob cannot be taken back. The manifest IS source
# (its version has to be bumped per release), so that one file stays tracked.
vocript-src/src-tauri/windows/**
!vocript-src/src-tauri/windows/msix/
!vocript-src/src-tauri/windows/msix/AppxManifest.xml

# Store listing artwork: marketing, not product, so it does not belong in the
# public repo (regla P). Keep it in VoCript-Core if it needs versioning.
vocript-src/store-assets/
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.cursor/rules/contexto.mdc
AGENTS.md
